---
// FamiliarDesign.astro
---

<section class="section-wrapper familiar-section" id="familiar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="familiar-card">
      <div class="familiar-content">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Zero Learning Curve</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Familiar by design.</h2>

        <p class="familiar-lead">
          The best file management principles shouldn't require learning an entirely new workflow.
        </p>

        <div class="ideas-tag-cloud">
          <span class="idea-tag">Predictable Navigation</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Clickable Breadcrumbs</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Tabbed Directory Switching</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Side-by-Side Split Panes</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Instant Drive Metrics</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Hierarchical Tree Clarity</span>
        </div>

        <p class="familiar-body">
          Maggo takes the most reliable, time-tested productivity patterns and marries them with a refined, 100% native macOS experience.
        </p>

        <div class="familiar-quote-highlight">
          <span>You shouldn't have to relearn how to manage files on your own Mac.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="familiar-visual">
        <div class="os-harmony-card">
          <div class="harmony-badge">Native macOS Integration</div>
          
          <div class="harmony-points-list">
            <div class="harmony-point">
              <div class="point-icon-box">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="point-text">
                <strong>Pure Swift 6 &amp; SwiftUI</strong>
                <span>Direct native compilation. Instant launch, buttery 120Hz ProMotion animations, and native macOS dark mode support.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="harmony-divider"></div>

            <div class="harmony-point">
              <div class="point-icon-box">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                  <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="point-text">
                <strong>100% Private &amp; Offline</strong>
                <span>Zero telemetry, zero cloud synchronizers, zero background daemons. Your files remain entirely on your local Mac.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="harmony-footer">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Open Maggo and feel immediately at home on day one.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .familiar-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .familiar-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 3.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .familiar-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .familiar-lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .ideas-tag-cloud {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .idea-tag {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .familiar-body {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .familiar-quote-highlight {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .os-harmony-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .harmony-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: var(--color-accent-subtle);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-border);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .harmony-points-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .harmony-point {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .point-icon-box {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .point-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .point-text strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .point-text span {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .harmony-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }

  .harmony-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(136, 84, 208, 0.25);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
</style>
